{"id": "f5", "text": "Science note, plainly. The forty-thousand-neuron figure is the commonly cited number, with a published range of about fourteen thousand to ninety-four thousand. The vagus traffic figure \u2014 most of it running heart-to-brain \u2014 comes from a review, not a lab constant. The four-to-six-minute window describes an unprotected brain with zero blood flow \u2014 CPR, cooling and a shockable rhythm change it. And the lab studies were small \u2014 twenty-seven men, fifteen adults \u2014 showing small changes, never total control.", "words": [{"word": "Science", "start": 0.05, "duration": 0.4375}, {"word": "note", "start": 0.5, "duration": 0.3125}, {"word": "plainly", "start": 0.8375, "duration": 0.6}, {"word": "The", "start": 1.825, "duration": 0.075}, {"word": "forty-thousand-neuron", "start": 1.9125, "duration": 0.8625}, {"word": "figure", "start": 2.7875, "duration": 0.425}, {"word": "is", "start": 3.225, "duration": 0.1875}, {"word": "the", "start": 3.425, "duration": 0.1}, {"word": "commonly", "start": 3.5375, "duration": 0.425}, {"word": "cited", "start": 3.975, "duration": 0.375}, {"word": "number", "start": 4.3625, "duration": 0.4375}, {"word": "with", "start": 5.1, "duration": 0.1875}, {"word": "a", "start": 5.3, "duration": 0.0625}, {"word": "published", "start": 5.375, "duration": 0.4625}, {"word": "range", "start": 5.85, "duration": 0.4125}, {"word": "of", "start": 6.275, "duration": 0.1125}, {"word": "about", "start": 6.4, "duration": 0.325}, {"word": "fourteen", "start": 6.7375, "duration": 0.4}, {"word": "thousand", "start": 7.15, "duration": 0.4625}, {"word": "to", "start": 7.625, "duration": 0.1}, {"word": "ninety-four", "start": 7.7375, "duration": 0.475}, {"word": "thousand", "start": 8.225, "duration": 0.5875}, {"word": "The", "start": 9.2125, "duration": 0.0875}, {"word": "vagus", "start": 9.3125, "duration": 0.3625}, {"word": "traffic", "start": 9.6875, "duration": 0.425}, {"word": "figure", "start": 10.125, "duration": 0.425